*> Harness-only MQOPEN: assigns a handle per object name.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. MQOPEN.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 MQ-HANDLES EXTERNAL.
   05 MQ-HCOUNT PIC 9(2) BINARY.
   05 MQ-HNAME PIC X(48) OCCURS 10.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 L-HCONN PIC S9(9) BINARY.
01 L-OD.
   05 L-OBJNAME PIC X(48).
   05 L-QMGR PIC X(48).
01 L-OPTIONS PIC S9(9) BINARY.
01 L-HOBJ PIC S9(9) BINARY.
01 L-CC PIC S9(9) BINARY.
01 L-RC PIC S9(9) BINARY.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-HCONN L-OD L-OPTIONS L-HOBJ L-CC L-RC.
    ADD 1 TO MQ-HCOUNT
    MOVE L-OBJNAME TO MQ-HNAME(MQ-HCOUNT)
    MOVE MQ-HCOUNT TO L-HOBJ
    MOVE 0 TO L-CC L-RC
    GOBACK.
